msgstr "Платежи, отмеченные как оплаченные"

#: templates/eos_invoices/log.html:57
msgid "Nothing has been marked as paid yet."
msgstr "Пока ничего не отмечено как оплаченное."

#: templates/eos_invoices/partials/copy-button.html:6
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Копировать"

#: templates/eos_invoices/settings.html:19
#: templates/eos_invoices/source_form.html:51
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Сохранить"

#: templates/eos_invoices/source_form.html:10
#: templates/eos_invoices/sources.html:10
msgid "Add source"
msgstr "Добавить источник"

#: templates/eos_invoices/source_form.html:29
msgid "Fields"
msgstr "Поля"

#: templates/eos_invoices/source_form.html:31
msgid ""
"Field names of the chosen model. Related models are reached with a double "
"underscore, as in a Django query."
msgstr ""
"Имена полей выбранной модели. Связанные модели доступны через двойное "
"подчёркивание, как в запросе Django."

#: templates/eos_invoices/source_form.html:43
msgid "Display"
msgstr "Отображение"

#: templates/eos_invoices/source_form.html:52
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Отмена"

#: templates/eos_invoices/sources.html:16
msgid ""
"Each source is a model of another app with one row per payment a Corporation"
" owes. The overview reads every enabled source for the Corporation of the "
"viewer's main character."
msgstr ""
"Каждый источник — это модель другого приложения, где каждая строка — платёж,"
" который должна Corporation. Обзор читает все включённые источники для "
"Corporation Main-персонажа пользователя."

#: templates/eos_invoices/sources.html:40
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Отключено"

